Z||000000||V8Fiero||08-27-2001||09:25 PM||||Ok. I have an 86GT with the 120 speedo. Would love to get some white face guages or maybe even red with white numbers. My question is would using the overlays ruin my speedo if I wanted to take them off in the future? Any suggestions?<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR>86 SE Gold<BR>86 GT Red <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/RedRavensig.JPG"> <BR>"Trying to change from V8Fiero to RedRavenGT"||||reg||5
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||08-28-2001||10:08 AM||||When you replace your gauges with white-faces, you actually remove the old gauge sticker- so yes, aside from getting a set of stock-appearance gauges, you cannot switch back easily.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
